    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/fse-home-decor/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The FSE Home Decor is a visually captivating and fully customizable theme tailored for interior designers, home stylists, decorators, and creative professionals. Whether you’re a design expert or manage a boutique for home accessories, this theme enables you to establish an elegant and modern online presence. With full-site editing capabilities, you can easily personalize every section, including headers, footers, templates, and layouts—no coding required. Its clean, aesthetic design is ideal for showcasing interior projects, room transformations, engineered hardwood flooring concepts, parquet designs, and unique decor items. The responsive, SEO-optimized theme includes areas for image galleries, blog posts, testimonials, and contact details, making it perfect for sharing design inspiration or selling decor products online. Seamlessly integrating with WooCommerce, it supports e-commerce functionality and is well-suited for furniture stores, decor shops, lifestyle blogs, and online interior design businesses. This versatile layout is user-friendly, compatible with core blocks, and works smoothly with popular plugins like Contact Form 7 for easy form management. With speed-optimized performance and mobile adaptability, your site will load quickly and look stunning on any device. Whether you’re offering style tips, promoting curated collections, blogging about interior themes, or managing a catalog for modern living spaces, the FSE Home Decor Theme brings your vision to life with style and flexibility, making it an excellent choice for anyone in the home decor and furnishing industry looking to shine online."
    },
